ab"} {"question" "q-81111" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "For a function $f:{R}^{n}\\to R,$ given by\n\n$$\nf:{{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ ⋮ \\\\ {x}_{n}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{x}⟶f({x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}),\n$$\n\nthe second derivative of $f$ is given by the $n\\times n$ matrix\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute the first derivative of $f(x,y),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x,y) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & \\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}) & \\frac{∂}{∂y}({e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2x{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & 2y{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the second partial derivatives: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2x{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})=(2+4{x}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2y{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})=4xy{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2x{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})=4xy{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2y{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})=(2+4{y}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nSo, the second derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =[\\begin{aligned}(2+4{x}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & 4xy{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\ 4xy{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & (2+4{y}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14070131/state.json" "file_sha256" "cbfed8d5ac8aed714d4ee90c33fe3f8b1cc32d8d027b77c3470a7b5d68567dab"} {"question" "q-81111" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14070131/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c7bb03c9a97a80a934eeb050314d775f797fa80674863257aabfac0318d9c116"} {"question" "q-81111" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14070131/state.json" "file_sha256" "cbfed8d5ac8aed714d4ee90c33fe3f8b1cc32d8d027b77c3470a7b5d68567dab"} {"question" "q-81111" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}(2+4x){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & 2{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\ 2{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & (2+4y){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}(2+4{x}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & 0 \\\\ 0 & (2+4{y}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}(2+4{x}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & 2{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\ 2{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & (2+4{y}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}(2+4{x}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & 4xy{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\ 4xy{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & (2+4{y}^{2}){e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & 2{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\ 2{e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & {e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14070131/state.json" "file